  Expected:
    status: unimplemented_engine_shape
    reason: IC contract-boundary-composition shape outside the rule-numbered IC verifier inventory (the IC dischargers serve the numbered IC-1..IC-8a suffixes only). The authoritative compiled Lean theorem T4_contract_boundary_and_result_plan_sound composes direct Invoke boundaries, preserves the exact CFG-derived function result inventory, and proves callable Ownerless/Owned rows add normal net 0/1 and no unwind result. EntryCredit is bound to exact function/parameter/topology identity; TargetFunded reshaping is source-sensitive; independent results need no synthetic entry. The Lean/checker matrices reject field/cross-shape entry funding, cross-function/site replay, missing/extra/duplicate rows, category swaps, invalid ownerless identities/reasons, forged owned sources, double/incomplete funding, unwind evidence, missing credit/discharge, owned-as-borrowed double release, and dead-call-site handoff.
